# Elementalist — a Two-color Lesser enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 4/12 Two-color Lesser enemies — 16 life, bribe 70 gold
# enemy: Elementalist (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0399.dck "Elementalist (Re/Ub, 4th)" [Tier 3 —
#   Manalink 3 file dated 2016-02-15; its first 18 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 15
#   lines (60 cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/elementalist.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 4)
#   [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/elementalist.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Lesser) — "Elementalist" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Elementalist
12 Mountain
12 Island
2 Gem Bazaar
2 Mana Vault
3 Air Elemental
3 Earth Elemental
3 Fire Elemental
3 Water Elemental
1 Wall of Air
1 Wall of Water
1 Wall of Fire
1 Wall of Stone
3 Earthquake
3 Fireball
4 Drain Power
2 Lightning Bolt
2 Unstable Mutation
2 Energy Flux
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   2 Drain Power, 1 Energy Flux
#   .vBlack  2 Drain Power, 1 Energy Flux
#   .vBlue   3 Red Elemental Blast
#   .vGreen  2 Drain Power, 1 Energy Flux
#   .vRed    3 Blue Elemental Blast
#   .vWhite  2 Drain Power, 1 Energy Flux
SB: 3 Red Elemental Blast
SB: 3 Blue Elemental Blast
